00:36:31.610 --> 00:36:33.070
Surely you want to owe me one.
你肯定想欠我一个人情吧。

877
00:36:33.490 --> 00:36:33.790
Yes.
是的。

878
00:36:34.130 --> 00:36:34.830
Poor Andy.
可怜的安迪。

879
00:36:34.830 --> 00:36:37.770
And Ed's performance was so amazing.
艾德的表演真是太棒了。

880
00:36:37.930 --> 00:36:40.470
Like, you could feel how confused he was.
你能感觉到他当时有多困惑。

881
00:36:40.470 --> 00:36:43.390
We had a fan question from Mojo in Michigan.
我们收到了一位来自密歇根州莫乔的粉丝提问。

882
00:36:44.090 --> 00:36:48.770
How uncomfortable was Ed filming these scenes where Robert keeps saying there's got to be
艾德在拍摄这些场景时有多尴尬？就是罗伯特一直说一定有

