00:36:48.770 --> 00:36:50.270
somewhere for her to fit in?
适合她位置的时候？

884
00:36:50.450 --> 00:36:52.790
I was so uncomfortable this whole episode.
我整集拍下来都觉得非常尴尬。

885
00:36:52.790 --> 00:36:55.870
Not as bad as Scott's Tots, but still really uncomfortable.
虽然没到《斯科特的托儿们》那种程度，但依然非常尴尬。

886
00:36:56.330 --> 00:36:57.150
Yeah, it's pretty cringy.
是啊，确实挺让人脚趾抠地的。

887
00:36:57.550 --> 00:37:01.870
Well, Charlie Grandy said it was extremely uncomfortable, this scene.
查理·格兰迪说这一幕拍起来极其尴尬。

888
00:37:02.050 --> 00:37:07.730
He said the biggest challenge of this episode for him was trying to escalate the discomfort
他说这一集对他来说最大的挑战，就是如何在不断加剧尴尬感的同时

889
00:37:07.730 --> 00:37:12.670
while still keeping it enjoyable to watch, which is, that's the sweet spot, you know.
还要保证观众看着有意思，这才是最微妙的平衡点，你懂的。

890
00:37:12.870 --> 00:37:18.070
He said that since this was his first time directing a complete episode, Paul Lieberstein
他说因为这是他第一次执导完整的一集，保罗·利伯斯坦

891
00:37:18.070 --> 00:37:21.130
was really helpful in suggesting shots and camera movements.
在建议镜头和运镜方面给了他很大帮助。

892
00:37:21.130 --> 00:37:25.590
And in this scene, for example, you might notice they start wide.
比如在这个场景里，你可能会注意到他们先用了广角镜头。

893
00:37:25.850 --> 00:37:28.250
They even start with like a spy shot through the window.
甚至还用了那种透过窗户偷拍的视角。

894
00:37:28.470 --> 00:37:32.310
